OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal over rape on cycle
OL,4,Apath
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for information as
OL,7,Fpart of an investigation into a rape
OL,8,Fnear a rail line in Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FThe attack took place at about 15:00
OL,11,FGMT on Wednesday on a cycle path near
OL,12,FClay Lane, Newark, which runs parallel
OL,13,Fto the train tracks.
OL,15,FOfficers with specialist training are
OL,16,Fgiving support, extra patrols are
OL,17,Ftaking place, and a police scene
OL,18,Fremains in place as investigations are
OL,19,Fcarried out.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
